<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3036" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκάτειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		prop. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>belonging to an</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκατος</span>, q. v.; esp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἱστός</span>”
				<i>foremast,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					IG
					2.793
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κεραία</span> yard
			belonging thereto, ib., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.91
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκάτειον, τό</span>, (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱστίον</span>)
				<i>small sail</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μεγάλα
				ἱστία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				6.2.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicr.
				10
			</span></i> (with play on 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>J. Tr.</u>
				46
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hist. Conscr.</u>
				45
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρασθαι τὸ ἀ.</span>, i.e.
				<i>take to flight</i>, prob. l. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκάτιον</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				163
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				64
			</span></i>.</div>
